### SEC EDGAR Filing Explorer — request collection

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Apple's filings
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings

### 2. Unknown ticker → 404 TICKER_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/companies/ZZZZ/filings

### 3. Lowercase ticker still resolves
GET {{host}}/companies/aapl/filings

### 4. Spotify's filings
GET {{host}}/companies/SPOT/filings

### 5. JPMorgan's filings
GET {{host}}/companies/JPM/filings